calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, January to February ran 22% of normal and March to April ran 278%. In 2026 on the middle, February to March came in at 32% of normal. Grid 17224 had its driest year in 2011 at 49%.</p>"}
